  "historyNote": "#5774, eff 1-21-94; ss by #7178, eff 12-23-99, EXPIRED: 12-23-07 New. #9065, eff 1-10-08; ss by #10332, eff 5-9-13; ss by #11032, eff 1-29-16; ss by #14573, eff 5-2-26, EXPIRES: 5-2-36",
